# vlmkit writes to three places and only one of them is configurable (--output).
vrt/results/      # `pnpm vrt` stdout logs, one file per gate (--output)
test-results/     # per-gate report.md + page.png, path is NOT configurable
.vlmkit/          # run-ledger.jsonl, appended by every gate invocation

# vrt/orders.har IS committed on purpose — it is the fixture the gate replays.
